{"seq":3,"slug":"tombstone-space-and-blob-management","title":"墓碑/范围删除回收、compaction filter 与 BlobDB 空间治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/sst-format-compaction/tombstone-space-and-blob-management","wordCount":2495,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"墓碑-范围删除回收-compaction-filter-与-blobdb-空间治理\">墓碑/范围删除回收、compaction filter 与 BlobDB 空间治理</h1><p>一个跨境电商订单库每天写入 3 亿条状态变更，其中约 12% 是&quot;取消&quot;与&quot;软删除&quot;。三个月后，运维发现 <code>rocksdb.total-sst-files-size</code> 已到 4.2TB，而业务侧统计的活跃订单只有 2.1TB——多出来的 2TB 不是数据，是还没被回收的墓碑与旧版本。LSM 的删除从不真正删除：<code>Delete</code> 只是追加一条比旧值更新的标记，<code>DeleteRange</code> 只是追加一段覆盖区间的边界。真正把字节还给磁盘的是 <strong>compaction 在两个层次上的判定</strong>——底层 compaction 丢弃被墓碑遮蔽的历史值，blob 文件 GC 回收已失效的外置大 value。本文把这条&quot;延迟回收&quot;链路拆开讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-墓碑是-lsm-的延迟空间成本\">核心概念：墓碑是 LSM 的延迟空间成本</h2><p>LSM 的写路径只有追加，删除因此必须被编码成一种<strong>值类型</strong>而不是一次擦写。RocksDB 的内部键尾部有 8 字节，低 8 位标识 value type，其中三类与空间治理直接相关：<code>kTypeDeletion</code>（单点墓碑）、<code>kTypeRangeDeletion</code>（区间墓碑）、<code>kTypeBlobIndex</code>（值被外置到 blob file 的间接指针）。它们的语义与排序位置已在 <a href=\"../lsm-architecture-write-read/key-encoding-snapshot-iterator-semantics\">键编码、snapshot 可见性与迭代器/merge 语义</a>中定义，这里关注的是它们<strong>占用磁盘多久</strong>。</p>\n<p>墓碑的成本是双重的：它自身占字节，更要紧的是它<strong>遮蔽的历史值还在</strong>——只要被遮蔽的旧值尚未与墓碑在底层合并，两者就同时躺在盘上。设活跃数据量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、已失效版本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>、墓碑量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，空间放大为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{space} = \\frac{L + O + D}{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>生产集群的健康线通常要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{space} \\le 1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span>（RocksDB 官方 Tuning Guide 的经验区间），其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span> 由版本数与 compaction 频率决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 由删除比例决定。二者都不是稳态的——各自有一个&quot;回收滞后&quot;，滞后越长盘上越贵。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;Delete / DeleteRange&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Flush:SST 落成墓碑 entry&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;Compaction 判定&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;非底层:旧值被遮蔽&quot;| D[&quot;墓碑 + 旧值同时占盘&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;底层 bottommost&quot;| E[&quot;丢旧值&lt;br/&gt;丢点墓碑,收区间墓碑&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;等待下层 compaction&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;空间归还&lt;br/&gt;sst-files-size 下降&quot;]&#10;  H[&quot;大 value&lt;br/&gt;超 min_blob_size&quot;] --&gt; I[&quot;BlobDB 外置&lt;br/&gt;SST 存 kTypeBlobIndex&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J[&quot;Blob GC 重写老文件&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[\"Delete / DeleteRange\"] --&gt; B[\"Flush:SST 落成墓碑 entry\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"Compaction 判定\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"非底层:旧值被遮蔽\"| D[\"墓碑 + 旧值同时占盘\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"底层 bottommost\"| E[\"丢旧值&lt;br/&gt;丢点墓碑,收区间墓碑\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"等待下层 compaction\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"空间归还&lt;br/&gt;sst-files-size 下降\"]\n  H[\"大 value&lt;br/&gt;超 min_blob_size\"] --&gt; I[\"BlobDB 外置&lt;br/&gt;SST 存 kTypeBlobIndex\"]\n  I --&gt; J[\"Blob GC 重写老文件\"]\n  J --&gt; G</pre><p>关键判定在分支处：<strong>只有底层 compaction 有权真正丢弃</strong>。这个约束不能靠类型推断，只能靠数据布局推断——若某层之下还存在更旧的键，丢掉被点墓碑遮蔽的值会改变读结果。RocksDB 因此把&quot;是否底层&quot;作为显式输入，而不是让代码从 level 号硬猜。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>何时可丢</th>\n<th>由谁决定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>kTypeDeletion</code></td>\n<td>仅底层</td>\n<td><code>BottommostLevelCompaction</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kTypeRangeDeletion</code></td>\n<td>仅底层</td>\n<td>同上 + 底层 compaction filter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被遮蔽旧值</td>\n<td>底层遇遮蔽墓碑时</td>\n<td>compaction iterator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kTypeBlobIndex</code></td>\n<td>随 SST 一并回收</td>\n<td>Blob GC + compaction</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>blob file 内 value</td>\n<td>blob file 被整体重写时</td>\n<td><code>blob_garbage_collection_*</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"单点删除与范围删除的落盘形态\">单点删除与范围删除的落盘形态</h2><p><code>Delete(key)</code> 写一个 <code>kTypeDeletion</code>，与普通写入同路径。<code>DeleteRange(begin, end)</code> 写一个 <code>kTypeRangeDeletion</code>，用户键部分编码成区间边界，语义是覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[begin, end)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的所有用户键。两者的回收机制完全不同。</p>\n<p>点墓碑的问题是<strong>数量</strong>。全球购业务按 <code>order_id</code> 逐条取消，一亿次取消就是一亿条墓碑 entry，每条至少几十字节且必须随 SST 层层搬运。<code>DeleteRange</code> 是把这一亿次操作压成常数的办法：按前缀或时间分片删除时，一条区间墓碑覆盖整段。</p>\n<p>区间墓碑的落盘形态值得单独说：它<strong>不混在 data block 里</strong>，而存在 SST 的专用块中，其 <code>BlockHandle</code> 挂在 metaindex，键名固定为 <code>rocksdb.range_del</code>（来源：RocksDB wiki &quot;DeleteRange&quot;，<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/DeleteRange\">https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/DeleteRange</a>）。读取时引擎用 <code>RangeDelAggregator</code> 把它与点查结果求交：seek 命中某键后，还要判断该键是否落在此 SST 的任一条区间墓碑内。因此区间墓碑的<strong>读代价随条数与层数增长</strong>——一条&quot;删掉 2019 年全部订单&quot;的巨型墓碑挂在 6 层里，每次点查都要在 6 层各判一次。</p>\n<p>权衡可以写成不等式：逐键删除的写代价近似正比于条数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与平均层数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{point} \\propto n \\cdot s_d \\cdot \\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单条墓碑字节）；区间删除把写代价压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，代价转移到读路径上每层一次的区间判定。实践规则因此是：<strong>区间墓碑要切碎到与查询模式匹配的粒度</strong>——按 <code>user_id</code> 前缀做合规擦除就切到 <code>user_id</code> 一级，按 <code>yyyyMMdd</code> 做 TTL 就切到天一级。一条覆盖半个键空间的墓碑是负债，不是优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"compaction-中的墓碑回收-底层语义与手动触发\">Compaction 中的墓碑回收：底层语义与手动触发</h2><p>compaction 迭代器在归并时按四种理由丢弃 entry，每种对应一个统计 ticker（来源：<code>include/rocksdb/statistics.h</code>，<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/blob/main/include/rocksdb/statistics.h\">https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/blob/main/include/rocksdb/statistics.h</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ticker</th>\n<th>丢弃理由</th>\n<th>前提</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>COMPACTION_KEY_DROP_NEWER_ENTRY</code></td>\n<td>同键有更新版本</td>\n<td>任意层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>COMPACTION_KEY_DROP_OBSOLETE</code></td>\n<td>被点墓碑遮蔽</td>\n<td>该层之下无更旧数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>COMPACTION_KEY_DROP_USER</code></td>\n<td>compaction filter 判定删除</td>\n<td>filter 生效范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>COMPACTION_KEY_DROP_RANGE_DEL</code></td>\n<td>被区间墓碑覆盖</td>\n<td>底层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>底层判定由 <code>BottommostLevelCompaction</code> 控制（来源：<code>include/rocksdb/options.h</code>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>kIfHaveCompactionFilter</code>（默认）：有 compaction filter 时才走强制底层语义；</li>\n<li><code>kForce</code>：强制把所有 compaction 视作底层，激进回收，读路径可能因&quot;层内不保证有序&quot;而退化；</li>\n<li><code>kForceOptimized</code>：同 <code>kForce</code> 但输出文件内不切分，减少文件数；</li>\n<li><code>kSkip</code>：跳过底层特殊处理，<strong>不回收</strong>墓碑，用于需要保留删除历史的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>自动 compaction 的底层语义受层叠结构约束，触发时机不透明。需要确定性物理擦除时用 <code>CompactRange</code> 显式指定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"rocksdb::CompactRangeOptions opts;&#10;opts.bottommost_level_compaction = rocksdb::BottommostLevelCompaction::kForce;&#10;opts.allow_write_stall = false;&#10;opts.change_level = false;&#10;db-&gt;CompactRange(opts, nullptr, nullptr);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rocksdb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::CompactRangeOptions opts;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">opts.bottommost_level_compaction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rocksdb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BottommostLevelCompaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::kForce;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">opts.allow_write_stall </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">opts.change_level </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CompactRange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(opts, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nullptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nullptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>change_level = false</code> 是关键：要求输出文件尽量留在原层，避免这次调用意外把数据推到更深层反而加重后续负担。合规擦除（GDPR 第 17 条被遗忘权、PIPL 第 47 条删除权）的正确顺序是：先 <code>DeleteRange</code> 覆盖该用户全部键前缀，再 <code>CompactRange</code> 强制底层，最后对比 <code>rocksdb.estimate-live-data-size</code> 与 <code>total-sst-files-size</code> 确认空间确实下降——<strong>发出删除调用不等于字节已消失</strong>。跨境业务还有一层：满足数据本地化要求时，擦除要在数据驻留的每个 region 内各自执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"compaction-filter-把删除逻辑下推到-compaction-时间点\">Compaction filter：把删除逻辑下推到 compaction 时间点</h2><p><code>CompactionFilter</code> 让应用在 compaction 的归并循环里逐键决策，把&quot;这条数据现在该不该存在&quot;从业务代码搬到存储引擎（来源：<code>include/rocksdb/compaction_filter.h</code>）。核心接口 <code>FilterV2</code> 返回一个决策枚举：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>返回值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>空间效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>kKeep</code></td>\n<td>保留原值</td>\n<td>无回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kRemove</code></td>\n<td>直接丢弃此键</td>\n<td>回收值字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kChangeValue</code></td>\n<td>改写为新值</td>\n<td>值可能变小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kRemoveAndSkipUntil</code></td>\n<td>丢弃并跳到指定 key</td>\n<td>批量回收前缀区间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>kRemoveAndSkipUntil</code> 是 TTL 场景的主力：淘汰 <code>2024-01</code> 前缀的订单时返回下一段起点即可整段跳过。两个语义细节决定它能否真正回收空间：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><code>IgnoreSnapshots()</code> 默认返回 <code>false</code></strong>。此时 filter 不对任何现存 snapshot 可见的键生效——否则会破坏快照一致性。代价是：只要有一个长生命周期 snapshot 打开着，filter 就不再删除它可见的数据。长快照（备份、离线分析游标）与 compaction filter 天然冲突，运维上要把快照寿命与回收及时性一起算。</li>\n<li><strong>filter 只在 compaction 时运行</strong>。刚写入的过期数据要等它经过一次 compaction 才被清理，延迟上界 = 该层級的 compaction 周期，不是写入时刻。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>实现要点是给 filter 一个稳定的 <code>Name()</code>——RocksDB 用它校验不同进程/版本的 filter 语义一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"blobdb-空间治理-大-value-外置与-blob-文件-gc\">BlobDB 空间治理：大 value 外置与 blob 文件 GC</h2><p>当 value 是商品图文 JSON 或履约快照（几 KB 到几 MB），留在 SST 里代价极高：compaction 搬运时会连带重写这些大 value，写放大被 value 体积直接放大。集成式 BlobDB（RocksDB 6.18 起并入主线）把它们外置到独立 blob file，SST 中只留 <code>kTypeBlobIndex</code> 间接指针（来源：RocksDB wiki &quot;BlobDB&quot;，<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/BlobDB\">https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/BlobDB</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"rocksdb::Options o;&#10;o.enable_blob_files = true;&#10;o.min_blob_size = 4096;                       // 超过此字节才外置&#10;o.blob_file_size = 256 &lt;&lt; 20;                 // 单个 blob file 目标大小&#10;o.blob_compression_type = rocksdb::kLZ4Compression;&#10;o.enable_blob_garbage_collection = true;&#10;o.blob_garbage_collection_age_cutoff = 0.25;  // 只回收最旧 25% 的 blob file&#10;o.blob_garbage_collection_force_threshold = 1.0;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rocksdb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::Options o;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">o.enable_blob_files </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">o.min_blob_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                       // 超过此字节才外置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">o.blob_file_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 256</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 // 单个 blob file 目标大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">o.blob_compression_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rocksdb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::kLZ4Compression;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">o.enable_blob_garbage_collection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">o.blob_garbage_collection_age_cutoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 只回收最旧 25% 的 blob file</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">o.blob_garbage_collection_force_threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>外置把 compaction 搬运成本从&quot;value 体积&quot;降到&quot;指针体积&quot;，但引入新问题：<strong>blob file 内部没有回收机制</strong>。blob file 一旦写入即不可变，其中的过期 value 只能等整个文件被 GC 重写才消失。GC 触发规则由两个参数控制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>blob_garbage_collection_age_cutoff</code>（默认 <code>0.25</code>）：只有文件号落在最旧 25% 的 blob file 才<strong>有资格</strong>被 GC。这个门槛防止 GC 去重写刚刚写入、垃圾尚少的文件。</li>\n<li><code>blob_garbage_collection_force_threshold</code>（默认 <code>1.0</code>，即 100%）：当某个合格 blob file 的可回收比例达到该阈值时，<strong>强制</strong>触发 GC，不受&quot;是否正有 compaction&quot;影响。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GC 只在一次 compaction 同步发生：compaction 判定某个 blob file 的引用被删减后，把其中仍被引用的 value 重写进新文件，旧文件删除。可回收量</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>eligible</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{eligible}} g_i \\cdot s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eligible</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该文件垃圾比例、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为字节数）天然集中在老文件上：年龄门槛只在最旧一端放行，而垃圾比例随年龄单调上升——<strong>新写入的文件不值当重写，老文件里垃圾最多。</strong></p>\n<p>电商场景的典型配比是：订单状态行（&lt;200B）留在 SST，合同快照、商品详情、物流轨迹（&gt;4KB）外置。两个反模式要警惕：<code>min_blob_size</code> 设得过小（1KB 级）会让大量小 value 也走间接路径，读路径多一次随机 IO 却不省多少写放大；<code>age_cutoff</code> 设成 1.0 等于允许 GC 触碰全部文件，会把刚写的热文件也重写一遍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>删除在 LSM 里是<strong>追加标记</strong>，空间回收滞后于删除调用；真正的归还发生在底层 compaction 与 blob GC。</li>\n<li>空间放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{space}=(L+O+D)/L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 由活跃数据、失效版本、墓碑三部分构成，前两者靠 compaction 频率控制，墓碑靠底层语义控制。</li>\n<li>只有底层 compaction 有权丢弃被遮蔽的值与墓碑；<code>BottommostLevelCompaction</code> 决定是否强制，<code>CompactRange</code> 是合规擦除的确定性入口。</li>\n<li><code>DeleteRange</code> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 删除压成常数，代价转移到读路径，区间墓碑要按查询模式切碎。</li>\n<li><code>CompactionFilter</code> 的 <code>FilterV2</code> 支持 <code>kRemoveAndSkipUntil</code> 做前缀批量淘汰，但 <code>IgnoreSnapshots()</code> 默认为假、且只在 compaction 时运行，长快照会直接阻塞回收。</li>\n<li>BlobDB 把大 value 外置以降低 compaction 写放大，blob file 只能整体 GC；<code>age_cutoff</code> 与 <code>force_threshold</code> 决定&quot;回收谁&quot;与&quot;何时强制&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>配套：SST 的物理布局与块句柄见同章节的 <a href=\"sst-file-format-and-index\">SST 文件格式、块编码与分区索引/过滤器</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"墓碑/范围删除回收、compaction filter 与 BlobDB 空间治理","id":"墓碑-范围删除回收-compaction-filter-与-blobdb-空间治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：墓碑是 LSM 的延迟空间成本","id":"核心概念-墓碑是-lsm-的延迟空间成本"},{"level":2,"text":"单点删除与范围删除的落盘形态","id":"单点删除与范围删除的落盘形态"},{"level":2,"text":"Compaction 中的墓碑回收：底层语义与手动触发","id":"compaction-中的墓碑回收-底层语义与手动触发"},{"level":2,"text":"Compaction filter：把删除逻辑下推到 compaction 时间点","id":"compaction-filter-把删除逻辑下推到-compaction-时间点"},{"level":2,"text":"BlobDB 空间治理：大 value 外置与 blob 文件 GC","id":"blobdb-空间治理-大-value-外置与-blob-文件-gc"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Compaction 策略选择、打分调度与并行度控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/sst-format-compaction/compaction-strategy-scheduling"},"next":{"title":"写停顿与背压机制：L0 限速、pending compaction bytes 与 rate limiter","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/performance-write-stall-memory/write-stall-backpressure-mechanism"}}